// Thirty bush beans on a 1.5 x 1.2 m loam plot, 40 cm deep, in five rows of six (25 cm
// apart along a row, 24 cm between rows, about 17 plants per m2), watered to field
// capacity every morning, under the temperate-summer preset at 45 N. The WP21 plot
// scenario: one soil block with 5 cm cells and one light grid for all thirty plants
// (decision 0019); its cost per sim-day is the M2 budget (under 20 ms).
